{"data":{"status":true,"competition":{"id":1765220,"visibility":"public","theme_colour":"purple-dark_un","paid":0,"title":"Prompt to Wars","festival_id":520823,"organization_id":561,"web_url":null,"start_date":"2026-10-02T00:00:00+05:30","end_date":"2026-10-22T15:00:00+05:30","location":null,"type":"competitions","public_url":"competitions\/prompt-to-wars-ai-fiesta-2026-inderprastha-engineering-college-ipec-ghaziabad-1765220","region":"offline","details":"<p><strong>Prompt to Wars:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Limited Prompts. Maximum Strategy.<\/p>\n<p>Prompt to Wars is a prompt-engineering and AI interaction competition conducted as part of AI Fiesta 2026, an 8-hour offline AI challenge organized by THINK AI at Inderprastha Engineering College (IPEC), Ghaziabad.<\/p>\n<p>Participants will complete an AI-based challenge while working within a limited number of prompts. The competition focuses on using prompts strategically to achieve the desired outcome efficiently and effectively.<\/p>\n<p><strong>What This Challenge Tests:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Prompt engineering<\/li>\n<li>Strategic thinking<\/li>\n<li>Effective AI interaction<\/li>\n<li>Problem solving<\/li>\n<li>Artificial Intelligence<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Format:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Participants will be presented with an AI-based challenge and must solve it while working within the prompt limitations specified by the organizers.<\/p>\n<p>This is an individual participation competition.<\/p>\n<p>Participants must complete the challenge and submit their work within the prescribed deadline.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Eligibility:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>The competition is open to undergraduate engineering students interested in Artificial Intelligence, prompt engineering, strategic thinking, and problem solving.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Event Details:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Date: 22 October 2026<\/li>\n<li>Mode: Offline<\/li>\n<li>Venue: AIML Seminar Hall &amp; CSE Seminar Hall, Inderprastha Engineering College (IPEC), Ghaziabad<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Rules &amp; Guidelines:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Participants must follow all instructions provided by the organizers.<\/li>\n<li>Participants must work within the prompt limitations specified for the challenge.<\/li>\n<li>Participants must submit their work within the prescribed deadline.<\/li>\n<li>Plagiarism, impersonation, or any form of unfair practice may lead to disqualification.<\/li>\n<li>Only tools and resources permitted by the organizers may be used.<\/li>\n<li>The organizers reserve the right to make decisions regarding participation, evaluation, and disqualification in accordance with the event rules.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Participation in AI Fiesta 2026:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Prompt to Wars is one of the three competitions conducted as part of AI Fiesta 2026.<\/p>\n<p>Participants may participate in one, two, or all three AI Fiesta competitions:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Built in 30<\/li>\n<li>Prompt to Wars<\/li>\n<li>AI Advertisement<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Winner Recognition:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>The winner of Prompt to Wars will receive a trophy and winner certificate.<\/p>\n<p>Eligible participants will also receive a participation certificate.<\/p>\n<p>AI Fiesta 2026 &mdash; Build it. Prompt it. Create it. Pitch it.<\/p>\n<p>Organized by THINK AI, Inderprastha Engineering College (IPEC), Ghaziabad.<\/p>","overall_prizes":"Winner receives a trophy and certificate; participation certificates are also provided.","regn_open":1,"regn_type":1,"regn_url":null,"regn_email":"","registration_clicks":0,"user_id":28297380,"moderation_status":1,"overall_leaderboard":0,"reject_reason":null,"display_date":null,"created_at":"2026-10-03T12:36:01+05:30","updated_at":"2026-10-04T18:39:41+05:30","communication_sent":null,"certificate_at":null,"remarks":null,"branding":0,"disable_auto_rounds":null,"certificate_config":null,"subtype":"general_competition","combined_leaderboard":null,"source":null,"short_id":"CY5qQFL","hashtags":null,"participation_certi